WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:21.688
Hey, Charlene

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.148
Yeah, Jake?

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:28.445
You, uh, wanna... 

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.697
go to prom with me?

00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:32.991
I thought you'd never ask!

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:34.617
I would love to

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:36.077
Oh, man

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:38.371
I don't know why I was just so nervous

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:46.755
Hey, Jake?

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:48.298
Yeah, Charlene?

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:50.008
Did you know that only like

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:53.553
2% of high school sweethearts wind up married?

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:56.264
And more than half of them end up divorced?

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:59.893
Yeah, I mean, when you think about it

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:03.188
with 7.4 billion people on Earth, the odds that we'd find 

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:08.276
our soulmates in this small town of 1,379 people is mathematically impossible

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.569
So we agree!?

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.488
I mean, we're good with this for the time being

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:14.365
but it's not gonna be, like, a long-term thing?

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.825
Oh, of course not 

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:19.245
I'd never want to be in a relationship when I go off to college

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.790
I love that about you

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:24.334
And I love you

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.384
Until orientation week

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:36.179
and then, we will never talk again

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:37.889
Oh, yeah, obviously

00:01:47.857 --> 00:01:52.821
(ANNOUNCER 1)
27 minutes and 35 seconds until the big game! 

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:53.947
(ANNOUNCER 1)
But who's countin'?

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:55.448
(ANNOUNCER 2)
I'm countin'! 

00:01:55.824 --> 00:01:57.951
(ANNOUNCER 2)
27 minutes and 29 seconds

00:01:58.159 --> 00:01:59.160
(ANNOUNCER 2)
28 seconds!

00:01:59.577 --> 00:02:00.578
(ANNOUNCER 2)
27 seconds!

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:02.288
(ANNOUNCER 2)
26 seconds!

00:02:02.664 --> 00:02:03.790
(ANNOUNCER 2)
25 seconds!

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:09.712
Huddle up, huddle up, huddle up!

00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:12.465
Alright boys listen up

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.594
Big game tonight

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:17.637
Yeah

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:21.933
A wise man once said to me

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:23.518
Life is a game

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:25.770
of inches

00:02:26.688 --> 00:02:29.691
And every inch we need, is around us

00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:33.153
We tear ourselves to pieces for that inch!

00:02:35.864 --> 00:02:38.283
We claw with our fingernails

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:39.659
for that inch!

00:02:41.119 --> 00:02:42.662
Isn't that the Any Given Sunday speech?

00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:43.413
Yes

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.498
What do I have to do to reach you guys?!

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:47.500
If you lose 

00:02:47.876 --> 00:02:50.086
you're gonna be known as losers, now and forever

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:53.423
You wanna be known as losers for the rest of your lives?

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:54.924
Huh?

00:02:55.383 --> 00:02:55.925
Huh!?

00:02:56.551 --> 00:02:56.968
Huh!?

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:02.140
We're not losers, Coach.

00:03:02.432 --> 00:03:03.433
What's that?

00:03:03.975 --> 00:03:07.020
We love football, but, but you're ruining it.

00:03:09.814 --> 00:03:12.442
Most of us won't ever play again at the end of this season

00:03:14.485 --> 00:03:16.154
But we will go on to be doctors

00:03:16.487 --> 00:03:17.447
and lawyers

00:03:17.614 --> 00:03:18.615
and teachers!

00:03:19.407 --> 00:03:20.783
Football's just a game

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:22.911
But life

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:26.080
Yeah, life

00:03:28.082 --> 00:03:30.293
is what we choose to make of it!

00:03:32.754 --> 00:03:33.755
Jake Ramsey

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.549
You are by far

00:03:37.175 --> 00:03:40.094
the stupidest kid I ever met in my entire life!

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:46.059
I'm done, Coach

00:03:46.434 --> 00:03:47.435
What does that mean?

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:49.812
I'm not playing tonight

00:03:51.189 --> 00:03:52.190
Me too!

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:54.359
Yeah I'm out...I'm out too...Me too!...I'm out!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.526
Hey, don't ruin this for me

00:03:55.818 --> 00:03:56.861
If we win tonight

00:03:57.904 --> 00:03:59.197
I've got a job waiting for me

00:03:59.197 --> 00:04:00.990
at Texas City Junior College

00:04:01.991 --> 00:04:02.992
Wait

00:04:03.159 --> 00:04:04.160
They have a football team?

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.161
Uh huh!

00:04:05.161 --> 00:04:07.747
And I'll be the special assistant of the special teams coach

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.082
If I win tonight

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:10.416
If we win tonight

00:04:11.542 --> 00:04:14.462
Well, then come on boys

00:04:15.338 --> 00:04:17.715
Let's go get ourselves a win

00:04:18.132 --> 00:04:20.885
and never see Coach again!

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:24.597
NO MORE COACH!

00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:25.974
NO MORE COACH!

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:27.600
NO MORE COACH!

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:29.269
NO MORE COACH!

00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:30.687
NO MORE COACH!

00:04:31.396 --> 00:04:32.397
NO MORE COACH!

